{"3821100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CliveWareGOLD", "steam_appid": 3821100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CliveWareGOLD™</strong> is a corrupted bonus disc from another timeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re running an unstable early build of <i>STRANGERSHELL_BOOTLOADER v0.9b</i> - scraped from a forgotten backup during pre-release testing of <i>Clive is a Good Guy</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access is provisional. Possibly irrational.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect memory bleed, identity echoes, and unpatched reflections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside, you’ll find: one unreleased film, nine fractured personas, a remnant world map, a pigeon with an agenda - and formats no system should still support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821100/extras/75dc75e09b5ab4cefd1a60a93684c90a.avif?t=1772360041\" width=1560 height=393 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is not just a game. It’s a narrative artefact. A clue cache. A glitch-core prelude to something bigger.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tinker Tailor Stranger Self – Short Film</strong><br>A surreal, unseen moment from Clive’s past. A man meets his mirror. And keeps talking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clive is a Good Guy – Trailer + Lore Map</strong><br>Trace the connections. Spot the inconsistencies. The Mirror doesn’t show everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet the Personas – Interactive Music Player</strong><br>Choose your soundtrack. Or let the voices do it for you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Pigeon Letters – Act 1 (Interactive Story)</strong><br>A fictional fragment with multiple outcomes — and codes that connect to the full game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extras, Easter Eggs &amp; Digital Detritus</strong><br>Scrubbed files, half-memories, corrupted notes. Everything’s here for a reason. Even the things that don’t open.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821100/extras/b814a715a62b4eb364135b23b39742e2.avif?t=1772360041\" width=1293 height=1291 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why should you download it?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You like free things.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You miss the weirdness of old shareware discs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You enjoy fiction that bleeds into the machine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You want to know what Clive tried to hide.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Some formats don’t open anymore. Others never closed properly.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From the makers of <i>Clive is a Good Guy</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A next-generation FMV game where nine personas fight for survival inside one man’s mind.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821100/extras/4df1e06c956df16bda64d71eea2d8962.poster.avif?t=1772360041\" width=1024 height=558 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821100/extras/4df1e06c956df16bda64d71eea2d8962.mp4?t=1772360041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring Neil Bell (<i>Dune, Star Wars: Andor, Peaky Blinders, Adolescence</i>) and a soundtrack by Sano DG (<i>Tekken</i>, <i>Drakengard</i>). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is where FMV gets dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<